From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LibreTag <dev@libretag.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:53:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 33/40] tracker 0.7.8: a reboot inside a Wi-Fi zone reports
 quiet (last zone kept in the state, matched with the stay threshold; Wi-Fi
 scan before the Bluetooth presence scan, an empty scan repeated once);
 version/selftest print the self-test (nostr, GPS probe, Wi-Fi scans, owner
 set) on a locked console; owner line printed even when the Nostr self-test
 failed; npub follows a new K0; a GPS search ends when the boot probe finds no
 GPS

---
 zephcore/src/lt_version.h     |   2 +-
 zephcore/src/main_tracker.cpp | 132 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 118 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

